Function Purpose <code>DefaultConfig()</code> the embedded mapping (<code>config/enerplanet-to-meme.json</code>, shipped through the <code>config</code> package), parsed once when the package initialises <code>DefaultConfigJSON()</code> a copy of its JSON text, for example to write out as the starting point of a custom mapping <code>LoadConfig(data []byte)</code> parse and validate a configuration from its JSON text <code>LoadConfigFile(path string)</code> the same from a file; the error names the file <p>A <code>Config</code> is immutable after loading and safe to share between tasks. Its exported fields <code>Name</code>, <code>Version</code> and <code>Description</code> carry the metadata from the file, and <code>Rules()</code> returns the number of top-level rules, for diagnostics.</p> <pre><code>cfg, err := t1k.LoadConfigFile("orders.json")
if err != nil {
    return err // wraps t1k.ErrConfig; the message names the offending rule
}
task := t1k.NewTransformTask(t1k.WithConfig(cfg), t1k.WithIndent("", "  "))
</code></pre>
